title: Salem2Start
---
<<declare $playerName="player">>
<<gatherVars>>

Entering the café, the smell of fresh desserts made you
salivate.

Salem stood nearby, giggling with two coworkers.

When the chimes rang, they turned to greet you.

Salem: "Hi {$playerName}!"

She walked over, looking brighter today.

Skull clips decorated her hair.

Salem: "Come, me and my coworkers made goodies!"

She pulled you toward the counter.

Desserts lined the racks—brownies, fifteens, caramel squares.

Coworker: "Is this the person you've been talking about, Sal?"

They stepped closer.

Coworker: "They seem nice,"

Salem: "Yeah they're my friend,"

She grabbed a plastic plate.

You blinked at that. Friends felt like a stretch.

-> Set It Straight
    <<incRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump SetStraight>>
-> Question Her
    <<jump Question>>
-> Go with the Flow
    <<decRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump Flow>>
===

title: SetStraight
---
You: "Friends?"

Salem glanced over.

You: "Salem...we've only known each other a few days,"

She flushed instantly.

Coworkers giggled.

Coworker: "Ah Salem, ever the sweetheart,"

They leaned on the counter.

Coworker: "You must like {$playerName} a lot already!"

They teased.

Salem whined, letting one lean on her.

<<jump Dragged>>
===

title: Question
---
You: "You think we're friends?"

Salem spluttered.

Her coworkers burst into giggles.

Coworker: "Ah Salem, ever the sweetheart,"

They leaned over.

Coworker: "You must like {$playerName} a lot already!"

Salem whined, letting one lean on her.

<<jump Dragged>>
===

title: Flow
---
You smiled and went along with it.

Coworker: "You must like {$playerName} a lot already!"

They teased.

Salem whined, letting one lean on her.

<<jump Dragged>>
===

title: Dragged
---
One coworker pulled Salem away to cut desserts.

They laughed together.

You almost forgot yesterday.

Coworker: "I should thank you,"

You turned.

Another coworker watched Salem.

Coworker: "You were with her yesterday,"

You glanced at Salem laughing nearby.

-> I had to do something
    <<incRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump HadTo>>
-> It wasn't that bad
    <<decRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump NotBad>>
===

title: HadTo
---
You couldn't ignore how Salem was treated.

You: "I had to do something,"

The coworker nodded.

<<jump OneByOne>>
===

title: NotBad
---
You thought back.

You: "It wasn't that bad,"

Silence followed.

<<jump OneByOne>>
===

title: OneByOne
---
Desserts were cut one by one.

Salem picked a piece and approached.

Salem: "Here {$playerName}, try some!"

She held it up.

You took a bite—it was delicious.

You: "This is really good Salem,"

You ate more.

She didn’t respond.

You looked up.

She stared softly, cheeks flushed.

A coworker nudged her.

She startled and pulled out a paper.

<<jump LookingUp>>
===

title: LookingUp
---
You were about to thank her.

Then you noticed her nervousness.

She avoided your gaze.

Salem: "I feel like I answered too seriously,"
She clasped her hands.

Salem: "The question made me think a lot,"
<<setBool SalemDiaImageState false>>

You smiled.

You: "That's fine, it's what I need,"

You stored the note.

She packed extra desserts for you.

You said goodbye and left.

<<pushObjectiveIndex "Doing the Rounds">>
===